*> reject-at: 85 2002 2014 2023
*> kb/Work PB1294 - ISO 13.18.54.3 SR4: "Data-name-1 shall be the name of a numeric data item in the report
*>   section." The entry TXT has a PICTURE of category alphanumeric, so a SUM clause cannot name it.
*>   cite.py: OK  13.18.54.3 4)  (Syntax rules)
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PB1294N1.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT PRT ASSIGN TO "PB1294N1.TXT".
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  PRT REPORT IS R.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-T PIC X(3) VALUE "ABC".
REPORT SECTION.
RD  R CONTROL IS FINAL.
01  DET TYPE DE LINE PLUS 1.
    05  TXT COLUMN 1 PIC X(3) SOURCE WS-T.
01  CFF TYPE CF FINAL LINE PLUS 1.
    05  TOT COLUMN 1 PIC 999 SUM TXT.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    STOP RUN.
